{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 ReaDancer is a dancing character for REAPER, inspired by FL Studio's Fruity Dance. It shows a character in its own floating window that dances in time with the project, and loads Fruity Dance sprite sheets unchanged. Needs the ReaImGui extension (install it from ReaPack).\par}
}
